※ pl4g-test: module
※※ A type that says how it is walked, for a program beside this one to walk.

※※ The numbers from one place up to, and not including, another.
@[export]
type Span = from : u8 ; upto : u8

※※ Every number the span holds, in order.
※※
※※ \param s the span
※※ \return each number from its start up to its end
@[export]
fn Span.each(s: Span, a: &mut arena) ⇉ u8:
    foreach i := s.from…s.upto:
        yield i
